{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17603","headline":"登乐游原寄司封孟郎中卢补阙 · 羊士谔","name":"登乐游原寄司封孟郎中卢补阙","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"爽节时清眺，秋怀怅独过。\n神臯值宿雨，曲水已增波。\n白鸟凌风迥，红蕖濯露多。\n伊川有归思，君子复如何。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"羊士谔","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17603.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17603","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}